WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with legs wide in a comfortable V, knees soft.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Exhale and fold forward, sliding the arms under the knees, palms down.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Walk the chest forward and lower the forehead toward the floor.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
If open, straighten the legs gently over the upper arms.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release the arms, bend the knees, and roll up slowly.
